The September 2026 iPhone event will see Apple announce the <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/iphone-18-pro/">iPhone 18 Pro</a>, the &zwnj;iPhone 18 Pro&zwnj; Max, and the foldable iPhone, which could be called the <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/guide/iphone-ultra/">iPhone Ultra</a>. There won't be an <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/iphone-18/">iPhone 18</a> this year because Apple is waiting until spring 2027 to launch the more affordable models.<br/>
<br/>
